{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"f79c5d52980c74d703e3cf78b481df77f78446d4a562beb225ed785ebfbfc222","digest":{"component_or_area":"CLI store initialization and mounting","key_entities":["rebar verify-commit-ticket","_cli/__init__.py","ensure_initialized","_create_tracker","REBAR_TRACKER_DIR","ensure_fresh","_reads facade","pure intercept"],"problem_keywords":["CLI initialization","store mount","pure intercepts","ticket store","centralized dispatch","worktree","initialization skipping"],"propositions":["Pure intercept commands like verify-commit-ticket fail with 'ticket store not found' in fresh linked worktrees because store mount is not performed before intercept dispatch","Store mount logic is currently replicated per dispatch arm and skipped entirely by pure intercepts, creating structural possibility of commands forgetting to mount the store","A single centralized CLI gate must run mount (ensure_initialized with init_only=True) before both pure intercepts and dispatch set for all store-touching commands","Commands with policy=none (init, scratch, explain, pure read-only commands) must not be force-mounted at the centralized gate and must continue working without a store"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787484626318052001,"uuid":"36d167b3-6ccd-44fe-a71d-44d82214ea69"}